HST Office: "Mẹo trong ngày" (Tip of the Day) shows 20 tips of HST Office instead of the upstream ones.

- cui/inc/tipoftheday.hrc: the tip list is replaced by HST's own tips: feature search (Alt+Q, accents
  optional), key tips (Alt), administrative documents (Decree 30/2020/NĐ-CP) and two-sided printing,
  đồng amounts, numbers in words (DOCSO, DOCTIEN), TCVN3/VNI to Unicode, dd/mm/yyyy dates, names
  (split, sort by given name, remove accents), CSV import, earlier versions, USB token signing, "Lệnh
  quen thuộc ở đâu?", Save As to .docx/.xlsx/.pptx, the offline guide (F1), shortcuts, spelling.
  Commands of the HST extension are named by their Alt+Q search words, so a tip stays right when the
  ribbon moves a button. No tip links to a web site; two run a command (.uno:CommandPopup, .uno:SaveAs).
  The counter in the configuration wraps to the first tip on its own (index out of range).
- translations/source/vi/cui/messages.po: the Vietnamese texts.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/unit/test_feature_search_ux.py (tip count, Alt+Q tip, Vietnamese text of every tip).
